{"t":"Arctic Faun's Island","s":"arctic-faun-s-island-0a5ae","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Arctic_Faun_s_Island_120274.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Arctic Faun's Island</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"map\">\n<img alt=\"Arctic Faun's Island\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"223\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Arctic_Faun_s_Island_120274.png\" width=\"270\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruled by</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Queen%20Eloise\">Queen Eloise</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Rabbit\">Silver Rabbit</a>, 10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Arctic%20Faun\">Arctic Fauns</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"organization\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Organizations</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">—</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"near\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Nearby places</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Vega\">Vega</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Folda\">Folda</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Senja\">Senja</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Local</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Hunting Places</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Quests</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><center><b>None</b></center></div></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><center><b>None</b></center></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">6.2<br/>June 10, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 500px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"Shown is the underground Arctic Faun Cave.\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"446\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Arctic_Faun_s_Island_Below_Ground_f2d5c6.png\" width=\"500\"/> <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"caption\">Shown is the underground <b>Arctic Faun</b> Cave.</p> </figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The <b>Arctic Faun's Island</b> is one of the small southern <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Islands\">Ice Islands</a>, located between the mainland (northwest of <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a>) and the islands of <a href=\"#/wiki/Senja\">Senja</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Vega\">Vega</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32115,31739,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32115, 31739, 7)</a>.  \nIt can only be accessed by shipwrecking there when taking the <i>shortcut route</i> with Captain <a href=\"#/wiki/Charles\">Charles</a> from <a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a>. Since this is a random event, you cannot freely visit the island — it can only be reached once every <b>20 hours</b>. However, you can repeatedly request the shortcut until you end up there.  \n</p><p><b>Tip:</b> The quickest method to trigger a shortcut is to stand near Charles on the Port Hope boat and repeatedly say:  \n<span class=\"keyword-highlight\">Hi, Shortcut, Yes, Edron</span> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Charles\">Charles</a> and <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">Hi, Port Hope, Yes</span> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Captain%20Seahorse\">Captain Seahorse</a>  \nuntil you are stranded on a random island.\n</p><p>A barrel on the island can be used to obtain two <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Enchanted%20Sapphire\">Small Enchanted Sapphires</a> and possibly other minor loot.\n</p><p>Although the island existed since the introduction of the Ice Islands in June 2001, it only became accessible to players with the Summer Update 2018.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Rabbit\"><img alt=\"Silver Rabbit\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Silver_Rabbit_d85c65.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Rabbit\">Silver Rabbit</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">15</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">0 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\">Meat</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Silky Fur (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Carrot\">Carrot</a> (uncommon)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Arctic%20Faun\"><img alt=\"Arctic Faun\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Arctic_Faun_9da5bd.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Arctic%20Faun\">Arctic Faun</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">300</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">300</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">240</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-105× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-5× <a href=\"#/wiki/Cookie\">Cookie</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Goat%20Grass\">Goat Grass</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-2× Fresh Fruit (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Shimmering Beetles (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Dandelion Seeds (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-3× Leaf Star (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Health%20Potion\">Great Health Potion</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Stone\">Small Stone</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Panpipes\">Panpipes</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grapes\">Grapes</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Rainbow%20Quartz\">Rainbow Quartz</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Wood Cape (rare)</li>\n<li>Leaf Legs (very rare)</li>\n<li>Wooden Spellbook (very rare)</li>\n<li>Die (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":["measuring-tibia-quest"]}